echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+(-2){R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+(-1){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id 17592186416435 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3af2aed8-fdfb-58cb-b98c-201c2c75c6e9" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-5$, $y=3$, and $z=2$" :db/id 17592186416408} {:answer/id #uuid "6a3aeef0-3b42-5088-81d5-6224943b8101" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-3$, $y=5$, and $z=2$" :db/id 17592186416413} {:answer/id #uuid "96134954-26b0-550f-90ea-4210c359ce29" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-5$, $y=-3$, and $z=2$" :db/id 17592186416416} {:answer/id #uuid "a47dea73-bd87-5856-8071-fe09e1271cdf" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=5$, $y=-3$, and $z=2$" :db/id 17592186416419} {:answer/id #uuid "ee09aac2-7ab9-5ad7-9ffb-67373e750c08" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=3$, $y=-5$, and $z=2$" :db/id 17592186416425}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3af2aed8-fdfb-58cb-b98c-201c2c75c6e9" :answer/type {:db/id 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=-5$, $y=3$, and $z=2$" :db/id 17592186416408} :answer-field/id #uuid "fd23a28f-9c20-551f-9dfa-96e071ee475a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186416434}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "2ad315bd-aaaa-532d-a173-690fb5924119" :question/math-academy-id "q-131586" :question/problem "Consider the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+3z &=1 \\\\ y-2z &=-1 \\\\ z &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard Gauss-Jordan method to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to reduced row echelon form, and then solve the linear system." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nNotice that the matrix $M$ is already in row echelon form.\n\nTransforming $M$ to reduced row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+(-3){R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=-5 \\\\ y &=3 \\\\ z &=2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSo, we have the solution $x=-5$, $y=3$, and $z=2.$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Reduced Row Echelon Form of a 3x3 System That Is Already in Row Echelon Form"}
